{"meta":{"id":"tt4701182","type":"movie","name":"Bumblebee","imdb_id":"tt4701182","description":"Sexta entrega de la saga 'Transformers', esta vez centrada en el \"hermano pequeño\" de los Autobots, Bumblebee. Tratando de escapar, en el año 1987, Bumblebee encuentra refugio en un depósito de chatarra en una pequeña ciudad en la costa Californiana. Charlie (Hailee Steinfeld), a punto de cumplir 18 años y tratando de encontrar su lugar en el mundo, descubre a Bumblebee, dañado durante una batalla y descompuesto. Cuando Charlie lo revive, aprende rápidamente que éste no es un VW amarillo ordinario.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt4701182.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hMANgfPHR1tRObNp2oPiOi9mMlz.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/999ihhyNsvFaXFPXfoayroYZEN6.png","genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"releaseInfo":"2018","released":"2018-11-22T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"114 min","imdbRating":"6.7","country":"China, United States of America","cast":["Dylan O'Brien","Hailee Steinfeld","John Cena","Jorge Lendeborg Jr.","John Ortiz","Stephen Schneider","Jason Ian Drucker","Pamela Adlon","Len Cariou","Glynn Turman","Peter Cullen","Angela Bassett","Justin Theroux","Gracie Dzienny","Ricardo Hoyos","Lenny Jacobson","Megyn Price","Kollin Holtz","Fred Dryer","Isabelle Ellingson","Mika Kubo","Felicia Stiles","George Anagnostou","Brandon Wardle","Krystin Goodwin","Nick Pilla","Sachin Bhatt","Tim Martin Gleason","David Waters","Antonio D. Charity"],"director":["Travis Knight"],"writer":["Christina Hodson","河森正治","Joel Erickson"],"trailers":[{"source":"FUqAEmcMa1k","type":"Trailer","name":"Bumblebee | Tráiler Oficial Doblado | Paramount Pictures México","ytId":"FUqAEmcMa1k","lang":"es"},{"source":"3p1967P3XhY","type":"Trailer","name":"Bumblebee | Tráiler Oficial | Paramount Pictures México","ytId":"3p1967P3XhY","lang":"es"},{"source":"hl2glIU7W10","type":"Trailer",